From 2fffc0bad8cdc62519fb04065a74c05e7fea08eb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: shkosugi <sin.kosugi@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 26 Sep 2026 19:20:45 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] DynamicData: build on .NET without LINQ to SQL / EF6
 ObjectContext

ItemType on data-bound controls calls DataBoundControlHelper.EnableDynamicData,
which loads System.Web.DynamicData; the project did not build and is not published.
Exclude the DLinq/EF model providers (neither framework exists on .NET), guard
LinqDataSource/EntityDataSource and System.Data.Spatial uses, add the project's
AssemblyRef and ScaffoldTableAttribute (not in .NET's DataAnnotations).
